# Tauri
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/apple/
src-tauri/gen/schemas/
# gen/android IS tracked, deliberately. Tauri has no merge hook for the Android
# manifest (unlike src-tauri/Info.plist for iOS), and the app needs a network
# security config there to reach the http://localhost asset server -- without it
# a *release* APK silently fails to load. `tauri android init` never overwrites
# existing files, and the generated tree ships its own .gitignore files that
# exclude build/, jniLibs/**/*.so and local.properties.

